The '''Holy Quarter''' was a location in the [[Jedha City|Holy City]] on the [[moon]] [[Jedha]]. During the [[Battle on Jedha]], [[Jyn Erso]] saved the young [[Gender|girl]] [[Pendra Siliu]] from the fighting occurring there between the [[Galactic Empire]] and [[Saw Gerrera]]'s [[Partisans]].<ref name="Rogue One novel" />

